 "description": "This deck has been disbanded because i dont like it any more.  I will post my new deck as soon as it is made.",
 "strategy": "I try to get three operative's with three ability 3 people ASAP.  I use that to flip my objective.  With Liberation up, I draw two battle destinies at each site.  I use the really strong people like Quiggy, Luke, and Obi to go out and hopefully beat the other players people or try to get them off my planet if they use Leave Them To Me.  My spacefleet should be sufficiant to repel a non-spacefleet deck and control Corellia.  With Corellia occupied/controlled, Taking Them With Us gives my operatives a nice boost.  Also, Menace Fades and/or I Did It should take effect.  With Menace Fades, their force drain bonuses are cancelled plus they are -1 from Liberation.",
